type: software
title: "C-SHAP vs SHAP: Interpretability Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A Python package and command-line tool (cshap) for Kernel SHAP with K-means
  centroid (C-SHAP-style) backgrounds, and an evaluation of the method against
  exact SHAP values on three public datasets and three model families.
